      "created_at": "2018-08-20T14:14:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<div>I played Akash'Thriya last night and had a few rules questions.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Hero Power - It says you can move cards from your hand or trash to the environment trash. Just curious if there are any ways in her deck to get cards into the trash or is this just to cover interactions from other decks?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>One with the Land - \"Whenever a primordial seed is destroyed you may move it to the environment trash\". I was under the impression this is where the seed cards went normally, or was I doing it wrong?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Rapid Growth - This lets you discard 6 cards from the environment deck. Can you do this 1 at a time? or does the number have to be declared before you discard?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>All in all I'm loving the new characters. Very different and tons of fun to play.</div>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:43.976Z",
