      "created_at": "2018-08-20T14:31:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Scatter Seeds is the main card play that could end up with Seeds in her trash but just normal destruction of those Seeds or forced discards is more likely why they would be in her trash&nbsp;</p><p>Seeds when destroyed go to her trash unless that card is in play.&nbsp;</p><p>For Rapid Growth it’s one at a time up to six</p>",
