      "created_at": "2018-08-28T15:41:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Here’s another one:</p>\n<p>I realized I don’t think I’ve seen explicit guidance on which play area Primordial Seeds go to when they are played from the Environment deck. (This is relevant for, for example, the Paradoja Figurehead.) Do they snap back to Akash’Thriya’s play area, or stay with the Environment?</p>\n<p>I guess the relevant thing to check in the video game is where Shinobi go after playing from a hero deck, but I don’t have Season 2 yet.</p>",
